<title>TAIWAN: China Steel says July-Sept profit falls.</title>
<headline>China Steel says July-Sept profit falls.</headline>
<dateline>TAIPEI 1996-10-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>July-September 1996</p>
<p>			 (in million T$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Turnover				20,557   vs    22,196</p>
<p>    Pre-tax profit			 3,996   vs     5,482</p>
<p>NOTE - China Steel Corp is Taiwan's largest steel maker. The company was privatised by the governemnt in April 1996.</p>
<p>-- Taipei Newsroom (2-5080815)</p>
</text>
